[0.0, "o", "64m**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m It's probably feasible physically, but no one has shown it makes economic \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[9;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64msense yet. The case for small, specialized uses is solid. The case for replacing large AI \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[10;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mdata centers depends on launch costs falling several-fold, and that hasn't happened.\u001b[12;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:140:175:210m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m### \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:140:175:210m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mWhy people want it\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m           \u001b[14;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:180:142:173m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m**Power:**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m In a [\u001b(B\u001b[0;4m\u001b[38:2:140:175:210m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m  \b\b🌿\u001b[14;25H:dawn-dusk sun-synchronous orbit\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b"]
[0.0, "o", "[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m](\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:201:130:107m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m2026-09-29.13-28-22.970.md\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m), solar\u001b[C\u001b[C \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[15;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mpanels are in sunlight almost all the time. There's no night, no weather and no\u001b[10C \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[16;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64matmosphere absorbing light, so the same panel produces several times more energy than it\u001b[C \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[17;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mwould on the ground.                                                                   \u001b[18;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:180:142:173m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m**No grid or permitting delays:**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m On Earth, the real limit for AI \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4:3m\u001b[58:2::191:97:106m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mbuildouts\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m is often\u001b[5C \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[19;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mgetting a grid connection, not the price of electricity. Satellite operators can bypass\u001b[C\u001b[C \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[20;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mterrestrial interconnection queues.                                                   \u001b[21;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:180:142:173m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m**No cooling water**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m, and no local opposition over land use.                          \u001b[22;4H                                                \u001b[23;4H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:140:175:210m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m### \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:140:175:"]
