[0.0125, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:180:142:173m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m**Generation is growing much faster.**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m In 2024 alone, China added 543 gigawatts of power  \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[2;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mcapacity—\u001b[2;15Hmore than the total capacity added by the U.S. \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4:3m\u001b[58:2::235:203:139m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64min\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m its entire history.            \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[3;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mProjections put it at roughly 400 gigawatts of spare power capacity by 2030.              \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:180:142:173m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m**The state plans where data centers go.**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m Under the \"East Data, West Compute\" (\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4:3m\u001b[58:2::191:97:106m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m东数西算\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m) \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[5;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mprogram, China is shifting energy-intensive data centers to its resource-rich western     \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[6;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mregions (like Inner Mongolia), powered with surplus wind and solar. In the US, by         \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[7;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mcontrast, the queue for grid connections is the bottleneck.                               \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:180:142"]
[0.0, "o", ":173m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m**Some sites skip the public grid entirely.**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m In \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4:3m\u001b[58:2::191:97:106m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mZhongwei\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m, \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4:3m\u001b[58:2::191:97:106m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mNingxia\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m, a dedicated 500-      \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[9;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mmegawatt wind-and-solar project wires straight into the servers, with no public grid in   \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[10;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mbetween. That's what space data centers promise, but on the ground.                       \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m                             "]
[0.0, "o", "                                                               \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mSo in China the binding constraint is \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m**chips, not power**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m. Abundant power does not         \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[13;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mfabricate a leading-edge processor China still cannot make at parity.                     \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m                                                                                            \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:140:175:210m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m### \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:140:175:210m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mWhere the \"no constraints\" picture goes too far\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m                                         \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136"]
[0.0, "o", "m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m                                                                                            \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:180:142:173m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m**The east is still short of power.**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m Reports point to power supply difficulties in       \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[18;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mheavily built-up eastern \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4:3m\u001b[58:2::129:161:193m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mmegacities\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m. The power is in the west, and many users are in the  \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[19;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64meast.                                                                                     \r\n"]
