[0.0, "o", "36m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[14;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64meffectively betting that \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4:3m\u001b[58:2::129:161:193m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mStarship\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m delivers, or that someone copies it.                    \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:180:142:173m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m**The motive is largely American.**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m As I said, the best argument is getting around grid   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[16;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mconnection queues and permitting, not cheaper power. That bottleneck is mainly a US       \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[17;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mproblem. China doesn't have it to the same de"]
[0.0, "o", "gree: it has 339 gigawatts of wind and solar \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[18;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mcapacity under construction —\u001b[18;35H roughly two-thirds of the world's total. So a country with  \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:90:101:125m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m↪\u001b[19;5H \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mplenty of power on the ground has less reason to put compute in orbit.                    \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:180:142:173m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m-\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m**The hype is American too.**\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m Much of it comes from US startups and \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[4:3m\u001b[58:2::191:97:106m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64mSpaceX's\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m IPO story.   \r\n\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:126:129:136m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38:2:205:206:207m\u001b[48:2:46:52:64m                  "]
